# Presenter duration → Timer/Rule/Destroy 链路验收&#xD;
&#xD;
## Header&#xD;
- scenario: lifecycle.durationSeconds 编译为 TimerSet 计划，唯一销毁链路 TimerSet → TimerExpired → Rule → DestroyPresenter&#xD;
